---
description: Always-on quality rules for the whole site.
alwaysApply: true
---

- Never invent facts, fees, thresholds, authors or credentials. Missing data shows "Needs confirmation".
- Ask before adding dependencies or third-party scripts.
- Keep JavaScript minimal; content pages should work without it.
- Run npm run validate:data, npm test and npm run build before finishing a task.
- Plain English, short sentences, no hype.
- Use Tailwind v4 utilities and the @theme tokens. No SCSS. No arbitrary color or size values.
